# MACHINE-ONLY routes: no screen can or should call these. One line each:
#   METHOD PATH  reason
# A line here that names no route in lib.rs turns the gate red (stale).
GET /healthz  uptime probe; answers "ok" to a monitor, not to a person
POST /api/bootstrap  BOOTSTRAP_SECRET-gated seed for scripts and the platform's two-step hub creation
POST /api/webhooks/stripe  Stripe signs it; its effect (a paid order) shows in Orders
POST /api/webhooks/telegram  Telegram's bot webhook (group links, member changes); its effect shows on the Telegram screen
GET /api/print/job/:token  the kitchen printer fetches its ticket with a venue API key minted on the Printer sheet
DELETE /api/print/job/:token  the kitchen printer acknowledges a printed ticket; the queue shows on the Printer sheet
GET /media/:name  image bytes; the URLs arrive inside the menu JSON and are drawn by <img> on every surface
GET /api/version  build identity {commit, built_at}; tools/deploy/deploy.sh reads it after a rollout to prove the live code is the commit
POST /api/print/poll  the kitchen printer polls with a venue API key minted on the Printer sheet; admin/printer.js only SHOWS this path to type into the printer (W-INT1: it passed the scan by that display string)
GET /api/webhooks/meta  Meta's subscription handshake (hub.challenge) when the venue registers its webhook; no screen calls it
POST /api/webhooks/meta  Meta signs it (x-hub-signature-256); its effect (a WhatsApp/Instagram message) shows in the owner's Inbox
